/** @mainpage InsightlyDataProvider Module

    @tableofcontents

    @section insightlydataproviderintro InsightlyDataProvider Introduction

    The %InsightlyDataProvider module provides a data provider API for Insightly CRM.

    To use this module, use \c "%requires InsightlyDataProvider" in your code.

    All the public symbols in the module are defined in the InsightlyDataProvider namespace.

    @section insightlydataproviderrelnotes Release Notes

    @subsection insightlydataproviderv1_0 InsightlyDataProvider v1.0
    - the initial version of the %InsightlyDataProvider module
*/
